<% content_for :title, "About Us" %>

<!-- Hero Header -->
<section class="brand-gradient text-white pt-28 pb-20 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-4 relative z-10">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-xs font-bold text-amber-300 uppercase">
      <span>Who We Are</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white">Building Healthy Families & Safe Spaces</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-purple-100/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-sans font-light">
      Connecting Hearts for Singles & Married Foundation was established to walk alongside individuals, couples, and children through life’s most delicate relationship transitions.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- Our Story Section -->
<section class="py-20 bg-warm-50 border-b border-warm-300">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-terracotta-600">Our Origin</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-plum-950">How The Foundation Was Born</h2>
        <p class="text-base text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">
          The Foundation grew out of the Connecting Hearts Experience, a relationship-building programme founded by Eloho Sodje and launched on July 5, 2025 in Warri, Delta State.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">
          After three successful editions exploring "This Thing Called Love", "Loving You", and "Love, Sex & Money", it became evident that attendees needed more than occasional events. People were dealing with marital conflict, divorce, grief, financial distress, single parenthood, and children affected by family disruption.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed font-serif italic text-plum-900">
          "We created the Foundation to turn occasional event conversations into an enduring institutional refuge."
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-warm-300">
          <img src="<%= image_path('pic6.jpeg') %>" alt="Connecting Hearts Community" class="w-full h-96 object-cover">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Vision & Mission -->
<section class="py-20 bg-warm-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      
      <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border border-warm-300 shadow-sm space-y-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-plum-100 text-plum-900 flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-2xl font-bold">👁️</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-plum-950">Our Vision</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">
          A world where every individual, couple, and family affected by relationship hardship has access to the healing, guidance, and support they need to thrive.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border border-warm-300 shadow-sm space-y-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-terracotta-100 text-terracotta-600 flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-2xl font-bold">🎯</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-plum-950">Our Mission</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">
          To connect hearts, restore hope, and strengthen lives through confidential counseling, therapy, child educational support, and compassionate community dialogue.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Core Values Grid -->
<section class="py-20 bg-warm-50 border-t border-warm-300">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-terracotta-600">Guiding Principles</span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-plum-950">Our Core Values</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-warm-300 space-y-2">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">❤️ Compassion</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">Meeting people with empathy, warmth, and non-judgmental care in their moments of deepest need.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-warm-300 space-y-2">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">🌍 Inclusivity</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">Serving all individuals regardless of background, religion, tribe, or status without prejudice.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-warm-300 space-y-2">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">🔒 Confidentiality & Safety</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">Protecting the privacy, dignity, and safety of all seeking counseling and support.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-warm-300 space-y-2">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">⭐ Excellence</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">Maintaining professional standards in counseling, administrative stewardship, and governance.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-warm-300 space-y-2">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">🌱 Restoration</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">Believing in the possibility of emotional healing, reconciled lives, and renewed hope.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-warm-300 space-y-2">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">🛡️ Dignity</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">Honoring the inherent worth of every human being and protecting vulnerable children.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Leadership Section -->
<section class="py-20 bg-warm-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-terracotta-600">Foundation Leadership</span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-plum-950">Guided By Dedicated Visionaries</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Founder -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-warm-300 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-36 h-36 sm:w-40 sm:h-40 shrink-0 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-4 border-plum-100 shadow-md bg-warm-100">
          <img src="<%= image_path('eloho-sodje.jpeg') %>" alt="Eloho Sodje" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-center sm:text-left flex-1">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-plum-950">Eloho Sodje</h3>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-terracotta-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Founder & Executive Director</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed pt-1">
            Visionary behind the Connecting Hearts Experience. Passionate about creating safe spaces, advocating for healthier families, and providing academic shelter for vulnerable children across primary, secondary, and tertiary levels.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Co-Founder -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-warm-300 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-36 h-36 sm:w-40 sm:h-40 shrink-0 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-4 border-plum-100 shadow-md bg-warm-100">
          <img src="<%= image_path('anthony-sodje.jpeg') %>" alt="Pastor Anthony Sodje" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-center sm:text-left flex-1">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-plum-950">Pastor Anthony Sodje</h3>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-terracotta-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Co-Founder & Trustee</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed pt-1">
            Providing spiritual wisdom, administrative stewardship, and counseling guidance to ensure the Foundation serves the Warri community with integrity.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
